  "body": "Situated in one of East Auckland’s most sought-after locations, 184A Bucklands Beach Road offers the perfect combination of space, comfort, and lifestyle. Whether you’re upsizing, accommodating extended family, or seeking a quality home in a premium school zone, this impressive residence is sure to tick all the boxes.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• 5 spacious bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, providing plenty of room for the whole family.\r\n• Multiple living areas, including a separate lounge and a light-filled sunroom for added flexibility.\r\n• Sunny balcony with elevated sea views, offering the perfect place to relax and unwind.\r\n• Modern open-plan kitchen designed for effortless family living and entertaining.\r\n• Guest powder room, internal-access garage, and a separate laundry with direct access to the outdoor deck.\r\n• Private backyard featuring a generous deck and lawn – ideal for children, pets, and outdoor gatherings.\r\n• Zoned for top local schools, including Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate,\r\n\r\nBucklands Beach Primary, and Pigeon Mountain School.\r\n• Conveniently located close to Bucklands Beach, Half Moon Bay Marina, local cafés, shopping, parks, and public transport.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a spacious family home in the highly regarded Macleans College zone are always in demand. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our open homes and experience everything this exceptional property has to offer.",
